A description body in an item takes a column-zero block after its first-block plus

````
- a
  :: t
  : +
```
x
```
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
      <dd>
        <pre><code>x
</code></pre>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
````

````
- a
  - b
    :: t
    : +
```
x
```
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b
        <dl>
          <dt>t</dt>
          <dd>
            <pre><code>x
</code></pre>
          </dd>
        </dl>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
````

